  "description": "Author portal for the We Do Care Global open-source portfolio by Emir Perla (Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina): the published-project dashboard plus the project surface it indexes. Every project listed here is archived on Zenodo with a DataCite DOI and attributed to ORCID 0009-0009-8515-2727. Covers agent governance and security control (AgentGuard, AgentVault), production retrieval-augmented generation (Enterprise Hybrid-RAG), agent evaluation and observability (Agent Eval), and pharmacovigilance and regulatory intelligence (Pharma Intelligence OS). All projects are Apache-2.0.",
